#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   Name            : HLARSH_GettingValues.scr
#   Description     : This script is called from mrT(HLARSH MENU) to fecth values and insert them in a custom table
#   Date            : 24-07-2013
#   Author          : 
#   Input           : NA
#   Output          : NA
#   Called Script   : NA
#   Calling Script  : NA
#   Menu Option     : HLARSH
